I found in the Revinron file this:
TAR=${TAR-'/usr/bin/gnutar'}

and i replaced it with:
TAR=${TAR-'/usr/bin/tar'}

Now it seems to work, it still gives me that issue with the boot library, but it works using:
packrat::bootstrap(sourcePackagePaths="/Library/Frameworks/R.framework/Versions/3.0/Resources/library/boot")

